			"id": "agent-analysis-appscope-identity-and-localized-app-strings",
			"interpretation": "AppScope is the application-level identity leaf of this HarmonyOS project: 8 tracked files, no ETS source, and no build or test entrypoints. Boundary: AppScope/app.json5 declares package identity (bundleName com.huawei.hmos.sample, vendor example, versionCode 1000000, versionName 1.0.0) and references only resources; base, en_US, and zh_CN resource trees plus three media PNGs complete the leaf. Relations: app.json5 binds label to $string:hmos_app_name, defined identically by name in base/element/string.json and both locale string.json variants, and binds icon to $media:hmos_layered_image, whose layered-image JSON binds background/foreground to the ic_background and ic_foreground PNGs; the root build-profile.json5 defines products but contains no AppScope-specific section, so AppScope config is not product-parameterized. Maintenance contract: keep the three string.json files name-aligned (hmos_app_name, internet_reason, network_reason, vibrator_reason), keep every $media/$string reference resolvable to an existing resource name, and change bundleName or version values only deliberately because they fix app identity across all locales.",
